## Objective
- Continue the signageOS bug bounty hunt in POC phase for `box` target, following the 8-step analyst protocol, by executing the next PROBE/HUMAN action to advance the confirmed IDOR mechanism (`api.signageos.io/v1/organization/{uid}/security-token`) from AUTH_HELPED (conf 86) to a proven cross-tenant exploit.

## Important Details
- Program rules: only `box.signageos.io` and `api.signageos.io` are eligible; passive-first (GET/HEAD only, ≤1 rps, no account creation, no data modification); secrets in commits must be sha256 only.
- Confirmed ACCEPTED findings:
  - `box.signageos.io/status`: unauthenticated JSON infra-leak (pod hostname, 64-hex process UID, Node v20.20.2, 9-service topology incl mongoDB3, CPU/mem, secgrep=0) behind CloudFront — 59+ cycles stable, POC finalized.
  - `api.signageos.io/v1/organization/{uid}/security-token`: IDOR mechanism CONFIRMED at byte-detail level (403074 errorDetail byte-identical, JWT Bearer ignored, X-Auth/x-oauth-client_id gating, org identity from header first-part before `:` vs client-supplied path `{uid}`) — AUTH_HELPED only, conf 86, zero auth drift across 6+ rs rotations (6cc9959bb4→77955558bc→7c5fdc9777→box-8676fb5f57→box-54846c877b→c877d9cc8).
  - `api.signageos.io/status`: hardened (HSTS/xfo/xcto/no-store secgrep=3) but still leaks hostname/uid/Node/topology (8-svc, mongoDB3 absent), 0 ACAO — differential vs box persists.
- Confirmed DEAD: videowall-designer leaked clientId/secret (sha256 `564c293ba2a1d60dd6e8f508a7ef65400424ae42b80be0ae04498d528a8a774e`) tested as X-Auth on prod → 403076 WRONG_ACCOUNT_SECRET "Account not found" — staging-only fixture, credential reuse disproven.
- Confirmed REJECTED classes: ready (200 "OK" 2 bytes), WebSocket (302 login), probe set /healthz/livez/readyz/live/metrics/env/config.json/csp-report/websocket (all 302 login catch-all), api CORS (zero ACAO everywhere → not CORS-exploitable), api descriptive errors (excluded class), box Auth0 OAuth2 (not passively testable without tenant/session), api pre-auth IDOR (all 60+ routes 403 JWT/X-Auth-gated, zero ACAO).
- All other surfaces behind Auth0 login catch-all; no unauthenticated bypass on box beyond `/status`.

## Work State
### Completed
- (none beyond what is captured in the knowledge base — the analyst is mid-cycle and needs to emit a fresh 8-step report per the protocol)

### Active
- Phase: POC, target: box. Model: laguna.
