### ACCEPTED findings (4 — all PASSIVE-proven, stable 59+ cycles)
| # | Asset | Class | Severity | Status |
|---|-------|-------|----------|--------|
| 1 | `box.signageos.io/status` | MISCONFIG | Low (5.3) | VALID — unauth K8s infra leak (hostname, process UID, Node v20.20.2, 9-svc topology, zero security headers, behind CloudFront) |
| 2 | `api.signageos.io/status` | MISCONFIG | Low (5.3) | VALID — same class but hardened (HSTS/xfo/xcto/no-store, secgrep=3); 0 ACAO |
| 3 | `box.signageos.io` CORS | MISCONFIG | Low (3.1) | VALID — 17 static ACAO incl. `http://` plaintext + `*.zdusercontent.com` wildcard; 0 credentials |
| 4 | `box.signageos.io` CSP | MISCONFIG | Info (3.1) | VALID — 40+ origins, triplicated Auth0 |

### HOLD findings (7 — all AUTH_HELPED, not passively provable)
| # | Asset | Class | Status |
|---|-------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `api /v1/organization/{uid}/security-token` | IDOR/CRITICAL (conf 86) | HOLD — cross-tenant mint mechanism CONFIRMED at byte level (403074 byte-identical across 6+ rs rotations; JWT Bearer ignored; org UID from X-Auth header first-part, path `{uid}` client-supplied); needs valid account + 2nd tenant to prove |
| 2–7 | Various IDOR/AUTH/MISCONF | — | HOLD — 403-gated without valid creds; PUT endpoints invasive |

### DEAD/REJECTED (confirmed not viable)
- `videowall-designer` leaked `clientId/secret` (sha256 `564c293b…`) — staging-only fixture; prod X-Auth → 403076 WRONG_ACCOUNT_SECRET — credential reuse disproven
- box `/ready`, `/healthz*`, `/metrics`, `/env`, `/config.json`, `/websocket` — all 302 login catch-all or trivial 2-byte response
- 60+ api `/v1/*`+`/v2/*` routes — all 403 JWT/X-Auth-gated, zero ACAO under evil.test
- All other surfaces behind Auth0 login catch-all

